WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.240
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today,&nbsp;
I’m going to explain a science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:09.360
fiction film called “Last Sunrise.” 
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
 
&nbsp;

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.800
At the beginning of the movie, a voice narrates&nbsp;
to us about the current condition of the world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.240
He claims that air-conditioning, oxygen, and&nbsp;
sunrise, are some of the most important things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:26.720
in the world, but now the world is void of&nbsp;
all of these. The narrator cannot remember&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.840
how many days it has been since the sun collapsed,&nbsp;
because it is difficult to tell with no sunrise.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:36.320
A few years ago, people used all the fossil&nbsp;
fuels, and everyone turned to solar energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:41.280
for their basic needs. The narrator laughs at&nbsp;
people who used to say no matter what happens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:46.800
the sun will rise tomorrow; because that is not&nbsp;
true anymore. The sun has completely shut down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.000
and the world has no source of fuel anymore. 
Cut to the day it all started; the story takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.400
place in a futuristic China, where everything&nbsp;
is almost fully powered by solar energy. 
&nbsp;

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:03.280
A young man named Sun Yang is woken up by a&nbsp;
futuristic AI robot named Ilsa. Yang analyzes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:08.880
satellite data from a multi-million dollar company&nbsp;
called Helios. Helios is the manufacturer of solar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:14.320
power that fuels three-fourths of China. Its CEO&nbsp;
named Wang is the centre of this historical change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:19.600
and is praised for his accomplishments. Yang&nbsp;
analyzes Helios satellite data, and updates it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.800
on his website. As he does this task, Yang&nbsp;
is bothered to see a nearby star disappear.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:28.320
He claims that the disappearance of this&nbsp;
star has some effect on the sun itself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.840
However, the AI robot reminds him that such a&nbsp;
deduction doesn’t follow the law of conservation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:38.160
of energy, so it is not possible.
When Yang gets out of his apartment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:42.320
we see every street and every shop using&nbsp;
solar panels manufactured by Helios.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:47.600
In the background, the company broadcasts the&nbsp;
development of solar energy in District 4,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:51.680
the only district left for Helios to&nbsp;
take over. Its logo is everywhere. 
&nbsp;

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:57.440
The following day, Yang is woken up by an&nbsp;
emergency alarm on his computer. He finds out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:03.040
that the sun’s luminosity has dropped by fifteen&nbsp;
percent and is continuing to drop quickly. The AI&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:08.160
tells Yang that his assumption about the star was&nbsp;
accurate. Yang quickly tells Ilsa to call Helios&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:14.400
CEO, Wang. Yang asks Wang if he knew that the sun&nbsp;
was going to die today. Wang instead questions him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:18.560
what he would do if today was the end of the&nbsp;
world. When Yang says he would find a way to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:24.000
survive, Wang gives him an address and asks him to&nbsp;
come there if he survives today. Yang then barges&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.640
into his neighbour’s apartment to get a better&nbsp;
view of the sunrise. As he stands on the windows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:34.320
he sees the sun flicker. His neighbour, Chen Mu,&nbsp;
is confused as to why he is here and asks him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:39.520
go away, but Yang doesn’t even blink his eyes as&nbsp;
he watches the sun die. TVs start to broadcast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:43.920
the event unfold, and reports of a flickering&nbsp;
moon from the other side of the world are heard.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:48.400
Suddenly the flickering starts getting violent&nbsp;
and everything goes dark within seconds. 
&nbsp;

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.880
Yang goes back to his room as Chen Mu&nbsp;
follows him, asking what is going on.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:58.320
He ignores her and asks Ilsa what is going to&nbsp;
happen now. Ilsa informs him that the temperature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:03.760
is going to drop to 0 Fahrenheit in a week and&nbsp;
-100 Fahrenheit in a year, oxygen will slowly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:08.320
deplete, all forms of life will disappear&nbsp;
and the Earth will become a frozen planet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:14.160
Yang asks Chen Mu to leave the city, and goes out&nbsp;
himself. People are confused and panicking. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:18.720
grocery store is full of people trying to stock up&nbsp;
supplies, but the cashier cannot check out because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:23.360
of lack of power. The lights are still working,&nbsp;
but they will be out in twenty-four hours.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:29.120
Yang takes a bottle of water and a map to help him&nbsp;
find the location Wang had told him about. On his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:33.680
way out, he is walking through a dark alley, and&nbsp;
a mugger hits him unconscious and injures his leg.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:39.040
He then takes his money. When he opens his&nbsp;
eyes again, Ilsa announces to him that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:44.000
slept for twelve hours and eighteen minutes. 
He rushes back to his apartment, and packs his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:49.040
clothes and some instant noodles. Chen Mu is at&nbsp;
his door with her backpack, asking for his help to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:54.640
call her parents. Yang tells her there is no way&nbsp;
he can help her and asks her to go away. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:59.920
when she mentions owning a car, the two decide&nbsp;
to travel together. Before starting the journey,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:04.480
Chen Mu makes Yang promise that he will take her&nbsp;
to her parent’s house after they visit CEO Wang.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:08.560
The two then leave for the place and&nbsp;
encounter a large traffic jam on the way.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:14.160
Chen Mu gets out of the car to go to the washroom,&nbsp;
and Yang takes this opportunity to drive away, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:19.760
is stopped by a crowd. When she is back, she asks&nbsp;
her why he is not in the place they parked, and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:25.040
lies, saying that he was making a U-turn. The two&nbsp;
finally reach Wang’s home at night, and meet other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:29.600
people who happened to be stranded there. 
They drink around the fire, while a socially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:35.680
anxious Yang stays in a corner. Later, his watch&nbsp;
runs out of battery and Ilsa stops talking to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:41.520
The death of the AI robot saddens Yang, as she was&nbsp;
his only friend. Chen Mu notices this and tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:47.200
comfort him. The two talk and bond. Later when&nbsp;
they wake up, Yang asks Wang what his plan is.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:53.520
Since Wang is a billionaire, Yang believes that he&nbsp;
has a way to survive. To his distress, Wang claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:58.640
that this situation is beyond repair, he wants to&nbsp;
stay in the place until death comes. According to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:03.680
Wang, a highly advanced civilization from far&nbsp;
in space is harvesting energy from other stars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:08.640
and simultaneously terminating life on other&nbsp;
planets. This time, the earth is their target&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:13.040
and they have been successful. A wormhole has&nbsp;
been created in the center of the solar system,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:17.680
and with the lack of gravity, all the planets will&nbsp;
soon fly away from the system including the earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:22.080
In the end, Wang gives Yang the&nbsp;
coordinates of a location of district four,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.560
and tells him he should go there&nbsp;
if he really wants to survive. 
&nbsp;

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:30.400
When Chen Mu wakes up, the two continue their&nbsp;
journey. The temperature has fallen exponentially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:35.760
so much that Yang’s bottle of water freezes.&nbsp;
Chen Mu notices a space shuttle taking off, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:40.720
Yang comments that it might be rich people trying&nbsp;
to fly away to another planet to stay alive. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:45.280
drives Chen Mu to her parents’ home as promised,&nbsp;
and continues his journey to the place Wang told&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:51.040
him about. However, he notices Chen Mu had left&nbsp;
her plant in her car and goes back to return it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:56.080
When he gets there, he finds a distressed Chen&nbsp;
Mu alone in the house, she doesn’t speak a word,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.080 --> 00:06:01.120
unlike her usual talkative self. All of the people&nbsp;
of the town had left in the time of emergency.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:06.960
We see the fish aquarium in the house is freezing.&nbsp;
Yang goes inside a room, and is horrified to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:11.520
both her parents dead in the bed. He takes a&nbsp;
letter from her father’s hand, and brings it back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:16.560
to Chen Mu. It turns out that they were preparing&nbsp;
for Chen Mu’s arrival before the death of the sun.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:20.560
As they wrote her the letter asking her&nbsp;
to take care of herself in the city,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:25.120
a group of thugs entered the house and killed&nbsp;
both of them. Chen Mu breaks down crying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:29.760
when Yang tells her that he too is an orphan and&nbsp;
doesn’t know who his parents are. He asks her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:34.640
come with him to district 4, the place Wang told&nbsp;
him about. The two then continue their journey.
&nbsp;

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:40.480
After a while, they reach district 3 and are&nbsp;
surprised how the map brought them the wrong way.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:45.840
Their car’s battery is dying, so they go a little&nbsp;
forward, and see a house selling electricity. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:50.640
they go in, an old couple welcomes them and claims&nbsp;
they have electricity that they extract from coal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:56.400
However, the woman then locks Chen Mu inside the&nbsp;
washroom and snatches the car keys from Yang.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.400 --> 00:07:01.920
They apologize as they take the car and drive&nbsp;
away. Chen Mu and Yang are in distress. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:06.400
are close to district four, but Yang’s leg injury&nbsp;
from the time the thug hit him is getting worse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:12.080
He tells Chen Mu to go there alone, but she&nbsp;
insists she won’t leave without Yang. After much&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:17.280
thinking, they make their way to district four on&nbsp;
foot. On their way, they rest for a while feeding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:21.680
on instant noodles and watching the beautiful&nbsp;
and cruel night sky. Without the sunlight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:26.560
it looks astonishingly beautiful. When they&nbsp;
reach the city area again, they find their car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:31.520
deserted by the side of the road. But just then,&nbsp;
a group of mineworkers comes looking for them. 
&nbsp;

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:37.200
To save Chen Mu, Yang turns himself in. They&nbsp;
take him to their headquarters and keep him as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:41.840
one of the mineworkers to extract coal. Chen Mu&nbsp;
however doesn’t give up and goes to rescue Yang&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:47.120
with just a pepper spray. She manages to free him&nbsp;
from the place, but Yang gets shot in the process.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:52.400
When they are back in the car, Chen Mu drives&nbsp;
to district 4 at full speed, hoping to save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:58.000
Yang. They stop at district 4’s entrance, and Yang&nbsp;
realizes that the place has geothermal energy that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:03.440
can save them. They continue their journey and see&nbsp;
the car’s windows and the road starting to freeze.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:07.600
They do not have a lot of time, but just&nbsp;
then their car runs out of battery and stops.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:12.240
With no way out, the two stay together on&nbsp;
the back seat, holding each other’s hand.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:17.600
An automated voice from the car says that the two&nbsp;
are experiencing their last moments on the earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.960
After a while, Chen Mu calls&nbsp;
Yang’s name but he doesn’t answer.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:25.920
Crying, she places her head on his shoulder&nbsp;
and falls asleep while freezing.
&nbsp;

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:31.040
Sometime later, a car stops beside theirs. A&nbsp;
couple comes out of it and brings unconscious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:35.280
Yang and Chen Mu with them. They drive&nbsp;
the two to a safe place in district 4.
&nbsp;

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:40.000
In the end, a voice in the background narrates&nbsp;
that the earth is moving at high speed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:44.320
into another galaxy. Soon, they will reach&nbsp;
their new home which has three suns.
